==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|u}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|urj-pro|fi}} {{recons|kola-|lang=urj-pro}}; cognate with Hungarian {{term|hal|lang=hu}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈkuɔlːɑˣ]}}
* {{rhymes|lang=fi|uolːɑ}}
* {{hyphenation|kuol|la}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{context|intransitive|_|+ illative}} To [[die]] of/from.
#: ''[[isoäiti|Isoäiti]][[-ni|ni]] '''kuoli''' [[syöpä|syöpään]].''
#:: ''My grandmother '''died''' of cancer.''

====Conjugation====
{{fi-conj-tulla|kuo}}

